:: Deadwood Remy Courtship
<<effects>>
<<if maplebirch.get('Orchard')?.remy.canCourt>>
  <<npc Remy>><<person1>>
  <<if $Orchard.remy.ended>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        "I remember how we left it," Remy says. You tell <<him>> you want to discuss starting again, rather than pretending the previous agreement never ended. <<He>> waits until you have finished before opening the office door.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        “我记得上次怎么说的。”雷米说。你告诉<<him>>，这次想谈重新开始，没有打算装作从前的约定从未结束。<<He>>等你把话说完，才打开办公室的门。
    <</language>><br><br>
  <</if>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Remy holds the office door while you step inside. <<He>> closes the register, leaving a finger between the pages. "You wanted to discuss something?"
      <br><br>
      <<if $speech_attitude is 'bratty'>>"Am I going to need an appointment to see you every time?" Remy raises an eyebrow. "You haven't so far."<<elseif $speech_attitude is 'meek'>>You ask whether <<he>> minds you coming just to see <<him>>. "I would have told you," <<he>> says. "You needn't whisper."<<else>>You ask whether these visits mean the same thing to both of you. Remy takes <<his>> finger from the register. "That depends what you have in mind."<</if>>
    <<option 'CN'>>
      雷米扶住办公室的门，让你先进去。<<He>>合上登记簿，一根手指仍夹在书页之间。“你想谈什么？”
      <br><br>
      <<if $speech_attitude is 'bratty'>>“以后找你，还要次次预约吗？”雷米扬起眉毛。“你之前也没约过。”<<elseif $speech_attitude is 'meek'>>你问，只是为了见<<him>>而过来，<<he>>会不会介意。“介意的话，我会告诉你。”<<He>>说。“不用那么小声。”<<else>>你问，最近的相处对你们两人是不是有同样的意义。雷米将手指从登记簿里抽出来。“那得看你想要什么。”<</if>>
  <</language>><br><br>
  <<if $remySeen.includes('livestock')>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        You glance at the door. Remy has left it ajar. You tell <<him>> that coming here must be your choice, and that you expect to leave when you wish. <<He>> follows your glance. "You can walk out now. I haven't stopped you." <span class='purple'>You cannot tell how far that answer goes.</span>
      <<option 'CN'>>
        你看向门口。雷米留着一道门缝。你告诉<<him>>，来这里必须出于你自己的意愿，想走时也要能走。<<He>>顺着你的视线望了一眼。“你现在就能出去，我没有拦过你。”<span class='purple'>你无法确定这个回答能管到哪里。</span>
    <</language>><br><br>
  <</if>>
  <<if maplebirch.get('Orchard').remy.farmConflict>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        You ask where this leaves Alex. "Exactly where Alex was before you came into my office." Remy rests <<his>> palm on the cover. "I haven't asked <<nnpc_him 'Alex'>> to join us." <span class='purple'>Your visits have not changed <<his>> designs on the farm.</span>
      <<option 'CN'>>
        你问，那艾利克斯怎么办。“跟你走进这间办公室之前一样。”雷米将掌心按在封面上。“我没有邀请<<nnpc_him 'Alex'>>加入我们。”<span class='purple'>你的来访没有改变<<he>>对农场的打算。</span>
    <</language>><br><br>
  <</if>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      You ask whether <<he>> wants you here as a partner. Remy lays <<his>> gloves beside the register.
      <<if C.npc.Remy.love gte 50 and $Orchard.remy.dates gte 5>>
        "I've begun leaving that chair clear." <<He>> looks at it, then at you. "Some afternoons, I've caught myself watching the gate. I'd like to know when you'll be coming."
      <<else>>
        "Most visitors leave when the lesson is over. You keep making time to see me." <<He>> studies your face. "I find I look forward to it. I'd like to see how we get on."
      <</if>>
      Outside, someone calls a pupil's name. <<He>> glances towards the window, then keeps <<his>> attention on you. "Is that what you've been coming here for?" <<He>> leaves the question with you.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你问，<<he>>愿不愿意以恋人的身份与你相处。雷米将手套放在登记簿旁。
      <<if C.npc.Remy.love gte 50 and $Orchard.remy.dates gte 5>>
        “我已经习惯把那张椅子空着了。”<<He>>看向椅子，又望回你。“有些下午，我会不自觉地盯着大门。我想知道，你什么时候会来。”
      <<else>>
        “大多数客人下课就走。你却总肯花时间来看我。”<<He>>仔细看着你的表情。“我发现，自己开始盼着你来了。我想试着跟你相处下去。”
      <</if>>
      窗外有人叫着学员的名字。<<He>>瞥了一眼，注意力仍留在你身上。“你一直来这里，是为了这个吗？”<<He>>等着你回答。
  <</language>><br><br>
  <<loveicon>><<lanLink ['Say you want this relationship', '明确表示愿意交往'] 'Deadwood Remy Promise'>><</lanLink>><br>
  <<lanLink ['Say you are not ready', '说你还没准备好'] 'Deadwood Remy Conversation'>><</lanLink>><br>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      You have not reached that understanding with Remy.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你和雷米还没有走到能够谈这件事的地步。
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<<deadwood-remy-return>>

:: Deadwood Remy Promise
<<effects>>
<<if maplebirch.get('Orchard')?.remy.act('romance')>>
  <<npc Remy>><<person1>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      "Then come back," Remy says. <<He>> offers <<his>> hand across the desk. You take it, and <<his>> fingers close around yours. "I'll expect to see you again."
      You ask <<him>> to find time to see you too. Remy's thumb stills against your fingers. "Tell me when. I'll see what I can arrange."
      <br><br>
      <<if C.npc.Remy.love gte 50>>A knock comes at the door. "In a moment," <<he>> calls, keeping your hand a little longer before letting go.<<else>>The courtyard bell rings. Remy checks the clock with a sigh. "A little more warning next time, perhaps. I do have a school to run."<</if>> <<He>> gets up to open the door for you.<br><br>
      "You can call at the house after the school closes. I shall let the gate staff know. Before eleven, mind."
    <<option 'CN'>>
      “那就回来。”雷米说。<<He>>隔着书桌伸出手。你握住它，<<his>>手指便合拢在你的手上。“我会等你再来的。”
      你让<<him>>也为见你留点时间。雷米的拇指停在你的手指上。“告诉我什么时候。我看看怎么安排。”
      <br><br>
      <<if C.npc.Remy.love gte 50>>门外响起敲门声。“稍等。”<<He>>回应，又握了一会儿才松开你的手。<<else>>庭院里响起铃声，雷米叹着气看了看钟。“下次不妨早点告诉我。我还得管着这所学校呢。”<</if>> <<He>>起身替你打开门。<br><br>
      “学校关门后，可以到庄园找我。我会告诉门卫。记着，十一点以前。”
  <</language>><br><br>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      <span class='gold'>Remy is now available as a love interest.</span> Choose <<him>> in your attitudes if you wish.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <span class='gold'>雷米现在可以被选为恋爱对象。</span>你可以在态度中选择<<him>>。
  <</language>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      No new agreement is made.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你们没有达成新的约定。
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<<deadwood-remy-return>>
